th, mapping the columns of one table onto another, and converting a table between formats — each with a single correct answer, graded against ground truth. Each question costs far less than an agentic task.","Reasoning: short logic, spatial and theory-of-mind questions, each with a single correct answer, graded against ground truth. Each question costs far less than an agentic task.","Models run at their highest supported effort setting. Where a different setting is shown, the model's name carries it: Claude Fable 5.2 is shown at xhigh because its max-effort run scored lower overall (84.2 at max against 84.9), behind on Long Agentic, Data Analysis, Research and Design and ahead on Browser Use, Reasoning and Coding.","Overall is the mean of the suites a model has a score for. Blank and n/a cells are left out. Every suite counts equally."],"provenance":{"releaseKey":"20261106","releaseLabel":"2026-11-06","assets":[{"url":"https://livebench.ai/data/20261106/table.csv","sha256":"1b3d53258209a8d6518059d032720e85586555a430da9fb6867fafadff10f6a5"},{"url":"https://livebench.ai/data/20261106/categories.json","sha256":"b5366a69719445fa91e970de6f248c666115bbc5d8b8d134f33bb5fcc399a7ce"},{"url":"https://livebench.ai/data/20261106/cost.csv","sha256":"d7f67d526e04883bb275fdd859954a68a4300b3862ad3c0b72c231bbfce81d40"},{"url":"https://livebench.ai/data/20261106/notes.json","sha256":"812556975b3e6306ad413a5be8918bd7990a8b43291e6955ee737939c4cc3a10"}],"applicationScript":"https://livebench.ai/static/js/main.8a7822ea.js"},"withdrawn":[{"id":"weighted","reason":"不同量纲的原始分不能直接相加；版本和测试配置尚未跨源核验。"},{"id":"aider-polyglot","reason":"历史编程测试不作为当前模型排行，停止展示。"}]}
